        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PR-BRK2RDHSBR, Hammered Brass Brooks Half Circle Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Brooks Hand Hammered Half Circle Door Pull comes packaged with 2 half circles made to be mounted on one side of a pair of double doors. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. If you choose back-to-back mounting please remember to order 2 sets of pulls, one set for both the exterior and the interior of a pair of double doors. Each of the Brooks Full Half Door Handles are made from hand-hammered brass meaning that each is unique. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BRK02-specifcations.gif?v=1704354735\" width=\"449\" height=\"208\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions PR-BRK2RDHSBR Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions PR-BRK2RDHSBR Brooks Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-17/25\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .38\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.38\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BRK02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262335\"><b>First Impressions PR-BRK2RDHSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 Sets of Pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 door pull handles). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pairs of Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Brooks Hand Hammered Half Circle Door Pull Set",
                "description": "The Brooks Hand Hammered Half Circle Door Pull comes packaged with 2 half circles made to be mounted on one side of a pair of double doors. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. If you choose back-to-back mounting please remember to order 2 sets of pulls, one set for both the exterior and the interior of a pair of double doors. Each of the Brooks Full Half Door Handles are made from hand-hammered brass meaning that each is unique.",
